From a232b5f2d7fb2ba38d12f305249d77ae1576129e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:21:36 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 10/24] inkling2: take the vision tower's output width from its
 projector

Small's projector writes 4,608-wide rows and Mini's 2,304. The tower reads the width from proj_out's rows,
the engine's image rows, broadcasts and splices use the decoder's hidden size, and a tower whose width differs
from it is refused at load.
---
